{"id": "3326727", "name": "שינוי סדר אינטגרציה – אינטגרל אחד מתפצל לשניים", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "none", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 2, "questiontext": "<div title=\"BGU_STACK_CALC2_Q7_REPAIR6_V1\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"width:100%;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1f2937;line-height:1.65;text-align:right;\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:14px;\"><div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;color:#4B1F6F;\">שינוי סדר אינטגרציה – אינטגרל אחד הופך לשניים</div></div><div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:14px;\">\n    <div>נתון האינטגרל</div>\n    <div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:19px;margin:10px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle I=\\int_{{{CT:0}}}^{{{CT:1}}}\\int_{x^2}^{{{CT:2}}-x}f\\left(x,y\\right)\\,dy\\,dx\\)</div>\n    <div>שנו את סדר האינטגרציה ל־<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle dx\\,dy\\)</span>. בסדר החדש התחום מתפצל לשני חלקים.</div></div><div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:14px;\">\n    <div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4B1F6F;margin-bottom:8px;\">חלק I – ערכי \\(y\\) הנמוכים</div>\n    <div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;\">\n      <div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:7px;white-space:nowrap;margin:7px 0;\"><span>\\(\\displaystyle y_{1,min}=\\)</span>[[input:ans1]]</div><div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#665f6b;\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div>\n      <div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:7px;white-space:nowrap;margin:7px 0;\"><span>\\(\\displaystyle y_{1,max}=\\)</span>[[input:ans2]]</div><div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#665f6b;\">[[validation:ans2]]</div></div>\n      <div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:7px;white-space:nowrap;margin:7px 0;\"><span>\\(\\displaystyle x_{1,min}(y)=\\)</span>[[input:ans3]]</div><div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#665f6b;\">[[validation:ans3]]</div></div>\n      <div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:7px;white-space:nowrap;margin:7px 0;\"><span>\\(\\displaystyle x_{1,max}(y)=\\)</span>[[input:ans4]]</div><div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#665f6b;\">[[validation:ans4]]</div></div>\n    </div></div><div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:14px;\">\n    <div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4B1F6F;margin-bottom:8px;\">חלק II – ערכי \\(y\\) הגבוהים</div>\n    <div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;\">\n      <div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:7px;white-space:nowrap;margin:7px 0;\"><span>\\(\\displaystyle y_{2,min}=\\)</span>[[input:ans5]]</div><div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#665f6b;\">[[validation:ans5]]</div></div>\n      <div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:7px;white-space:nowrap;margin:7px 0;\"><span>\\(\\displaystyle y_{2,max}=\\)</span>[[input:ans6]]</div><div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#665f6b;\">[[validation:ans6]]</div></div>\n      <div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:7px;white-space:nowrap;margin:7px 0;\"><span>\\(\\displaystyle x_{2,min}(y)=\\)</span>[[input:ans7]]</div><div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#665f6b;\">[[validation:ans7]]</div></div>\n      <div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:7px;white-space:nowrap;margin:7px 0;\"><span>\\(\\displaystyle x_{2,max}(y)=\\)</span>[[input:ans8]]</div><div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#665f6b;\">[[validation:ans8]]</div></div>\n    </div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"width: 100%; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_CALC2_Q7_REPAIR6_V1\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">פתרון מלא</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<p>התחום נמצא בין הפרבולה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle y=x^2\\)</span> לבין הישר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle y={{CT:2}}-x\\)</span>.</p>\n<p>נקודות החיתוך מתקבלות מן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle x^2={{CT:2}}-x\\)</span>, ולכן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle x={{CT:0}},{{CT:1}}\\)</span>.</p>\n<p>בסריקה אופקית הגבול הימני משתנה בגובה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle y={{CT:3}}\\)</span>.</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 17px;\">\\(\\displaystyle I=\\int_0^{{{CT:3}}}\\int_{-\\sqrt y}^{\\sqrt y}f\\left(x,y\\right)\\,dx\\,dy+\\int_{{{CT:4}}}^{{{CT:5}}}\\int_{-\\sqrt y}^{{{CT:2}}-y}f\\left(x,y\\right)\\,dx\\,dy\\)</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "specificfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">[[feedback:prt1]] [[feedback:prt2]] [[feedback:prt3]] [[feedback:prt4]] [[feedback:prt5]] [[feedback:prt6]] [[feedback:prt7]] [[feedback:prt8]]</div>", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">חלק מן התשובה נכון. בדקו את שאר הרכיבים.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה עדיין אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 7, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, 